[?1h=[33m484f5ae[m[33m ([m[1;36mHEAD -> [m[1;32mmaster[m[33m)[m BugSwarm patches; use 'git reset --hard 28722c52329753324ac4615d7aeae85d66c88461' to revert[m
[33m28722c5[m Merge a85a01b5acdd25eb290af9c12d4b15c34f00223d into 1ba4c40596f887f5040a60cd407b94751d65589f[m
[33ma85a01b[m Quiesce the continuous integration builds a bit by running maven in batch mode (reducing chatter from download progress logging)[m
[33m76b1a74[m Fix travis failures by moving to container-based travis which doesn't invoke the OpenJDK7 bug in getHostAddress (which crashes the VM during GWT tests)[m
[33m1ce34b6[m Publish the hitherto internal AutoValue guide as value/userguide.[m
[33me9345ec[m Add stronger scare-text to the javadoc for AutoValueExtension. The intent is to allow a 1.2 release without having to finalize this API. ------------- C[m [33m[mreated by MOE: https://github.com/google/moe MOE_MIGRATED_REVID=110406055[m
[33mf4ae374[m Make it an error for an @AutoValue property to be @Nullable and have primitive type.[m
[33mf37401e[m Make AnnotationValues public.[m
[33mde66f23[m Fixing AutoValue support for nullable properties using copyOf. This should work properly for @Nullable primitive properties.[m
[33m82cd13b[m Automated g4 rollback of changelist 109206967.[m
[33mdebd32d[m Fix AutoValue builders to support nullable properties using copyOf behavior without passing null to copyOf. ImmutableList.copyOf, for example, thows an [m [33m[mNPE when passed a null.[m
[33m1d5ba03[m Extend EclipseHack with code that means that we can handle inheriting generic methods from interfaces.[m
[33m58ef8e1[m Package com.google.* classes under autovalue.shaded.com.google.*[m
[33m468d866[m Add a link to the AutoValue user's guide in the AutoValueProcessor[m
[33me13c955[m Improve the logic of MoreTypes.equivalence() so that it no longer considers that Set<Set<Object>> is the same as Set<Set<String>>.[m
[33m2934a31[m Fix a bug where AutoValue generated incorrect code if a method with a generic parameter was inherited by a class that supplies a concrete type for that [m [33m[mparameter. For example `StringIterator implements Iterator<String>`, where the type of `next()` is String, not T.[m
[33macd2efb[m Fix the javadoc of AutoValueExtension, based on the changes in https://github.com/google/auto/pull/285 by rharter.[m
[33mf8801fb[m Allow an AutoValue.Builder type to define both `void setStrings(ImmutableList<Strings>)` and `ImmutableList.Builder<Strings> stringsBuilder()`.[m
[33m59d9bad[m Minor fixes to the README.md[m
